        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Actually, it looks like this is a bug/unwanted side effect in Neovim that will be solved in the upcoming 0.10 release. See: https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/25078.\r\n\r\nI'd still welcome suggestions on how to fix this in 0.9, but at least I'm not crazy, and this _is_ unexpected behavior.",
