        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thank you for the pointer. I did try that event, but it doesn't trigger when `filetype` is unset, which happens e.g. in files for which I have no ft plugin, or when doing `:new`. \r\n\r\nI agree it's better than what I had, given the existing issue with `BufEnter`, so it seems like this is the best approach for now, until 0.10 rolls around.",
